{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達獨立董事聘請了律師事務所Wachtell， Lipton， Rosen &amp; Katz來協助調查行政總裁黃仁勳。根據周二發佈的簡短聲明，董事們已聘請Wachtell Lipton的Joon H． Kim負責「進行全面且獨立的調查」。Kim曾任紐約南區代理聯邦檢察官。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585842.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T21:27:23.064373+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:11:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T21:20:40.290447+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:20:40.290447+00:00","content_hash":"a621154cff2ab84fde85cf682351ae96139cac4cc1d1c9b865b69a87b8c0e843","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}